    "raw_output": "```javascript\nexports.capPerKey = function(keys, limit) {\n  if (limit < 0) {\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  const result = [];\n  const map = new Map();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {\n    const key = keys[i];\n    if (map.has(key)) {\n      map.get(key).push(i);\n    } else {\n      map.set(key, [i]);\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (const [key, indices] of map.entries()) {\n    if (indices.length > limit) {\n      indices = indices.slice(0, limit);\n    }\n    result.push(...indices);\n  }\n\n  return result.length > 0 ? result : null;\n};\n```<|im_end|>",
